WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:04.710
Josh Brolin has been a formidable presence
in Hollywood since he was a teen, but these

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.920
days, his body is getting as much attention
as his body of work.

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:12.309
The acclaimed actor has packed on a ton of
muscle for an upcoming larger-than-life role.

00:00:12.309 --> 00:00:17.590
Here's how Josh Brolin got so massively jacked
for his role as Cable in Deadpool 2.

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.000
Comically large

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.730
Brolin's ascension to swoleness began on the
page, with the actor taking a few drawings

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:26.529
of Cable to one of his personal trainers to
get specific about what he wanted.

00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:30.980
But here's the thing—Cable's most well-known
look was put together by Rob Liefeld, an artist

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:35.750
whose work is frequently defined by insanely
pumped-up, stylized, and unrealistic body

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.750
shapes.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:40.790
Justin Lovato, a personal trainer and bodybuilder
who worked with Brolin on his look, said to

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:45.710
get even halfway close to the insanely huge
upper body Cable has in the comics, Brolin

00:00:45.710 --> 00:00:49.420
spent three hours a day in the gym for six
weeks straight.

00:00:49.420 --> 00:00:50.870
Killing the carbs

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:55.060
Brolin had to wean himself off of carbohydrates
to get cut like Cable, and he wasn't happy

00:00:55.060 --> 00:00:56.240
about it at first.

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.240
In one of many of his inspirational Instagram
posts, Brolin laid it all out: "Cable's coming,

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.670
growing from the inside.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:07.080
Clean building from a past of donut travel
to the present hard case that he is.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.080
No sugar.

00:01:08.080 --> 00:01:09.080
No bread.

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:10.080
No pastas.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.080
The machine is being built.

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.170
I'm pissed off."

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.500
In another post, a recording of an upper-body
workout, he shared his pride in going "totally

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.470
clean": "No drugs, none of it.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:22.210
Fish, rice, eggs, veggies, water ... I'm almost
50.

00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.230
It's a different time: our access along with
some big picture discipline results in always

00:01:26.230 --> 00:01:28.000
surprising milestones.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:29.860
Get on the train."

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:30.860
Cheat day

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:36.090
To transform into Cable, Brolin says it required
intense mental focus to stay in a fit frame

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:40.160
of mind, but it's also okay to have a cheat
day, as long as it benefits that mindset.

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:44.530
"This challenge has been an awakening that
there is no excuse, ever, but there's no need

00:01:44.530 --> 00:01:45.770
for perfection.

00:01:45.770 --> 00:01:47.930
Cheat days replenish and tell your body it's
okay.

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:52.060
It keeps it from panicking, which usually
shuts it down and ends up giving you a worse

00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:53.060
result.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:56.600
Keep at it, then when that day comes, MURDER
THAT FRIGGIN DONUT!"

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:58.040
Support network

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:02.600
Of course no one gets movie-star buff without
a little professional help, and Brolin acknowledged

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.290
that the progress he made with his body is
the result of a team effort, writing, "It

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:09.660
takes a small village," in an Instagram post
tipping his hat to his trainer.

00:02:09.660 --> 00:02:13.830
And of course, he always has a shout out for
Kathryn Brolin, his wife, business partner,

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:17.620
and frequently the eye behind the camera for
his fitness clips on social media.

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:22.640
The actor also finds encouragement through
fellow members of the thespian league of muscleheads—performers

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:27.370
like professional wrestler-turned-actor Dave
Bautista, a man Brolin calls his "great swole

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:28.379
mentor."

00:02:28.379 --> 00:02:32.840
Brolin also related a delightful encounter
he had with the man who plays Drax the Destroyer

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:33.989
in a post on Instagram.

00:02:33.989 --> 00:02:38.269
"Just saw @davebautista at the gym and he
said: 'What the f--- happened to you?!'

00:02:38.269 --> 00:02:39.269
Haha.

00:02:39.269 --> 00:02:40.450
Best compliment ever."

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.090
Friendly competition

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.599
While positive encouragement is always nice,
having a rival can be beneficial, as well,

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.180
encouraging a spirit of a competition.

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:52.041
Brolin has gotten plenty of that motivation
from Deadpool 2 co-star Ryan Reynolds, who

00:02:52.041 --> 00:02:57.610
tags social media photos of Cable "#PremiumCABLE"
and "#Maximuma------."

00:02:57.610 --> 00:03:00.700
For his part, Brolin is more than capable
of firing back.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:05.329
On Instagram he shared a photo of the two
stars side-by-side on competing magazine covers:

00:03:05.329 --> 00:03:09.709
"Ryan Reynolds' Smart Ass Secrets or Josh
Brolin's beating his demons to become Hollywood's

00:03:09.709 --> 00:03:11.179
go to Hellraiser?

00:03:11.179 --> 00:03:13.059
... It's just not fair."

00:03:13.059 --> 00:03:14.059
On brand

00:03:14.059 --> 00:03:18.959
Along with his wife Kathryn, the actor recently
launched an activewear clothing line, Prevail,

00:03:18.959 --> 00:03:21.930
which he promotes in his workout posts and
frequently sport.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:26.290
It's not just for his own bottom line, either—the
limited edition CABLESWOLE line of t-shirts,

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:31.340
tank tops, and hoodies benefits organizations
like the St. Jude's Children's Research Hospital.

00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:35.920
So in addition to keeping him healthy, getting
swole for Deadpool 2 has also helped the 49-year-old

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:39.409
raise money for charity and promote the family
business.

00:03:39.409 --> 00:03:40.469
Double duty

00:03:40.469 --> 00:03:44.430
Brolin is not only getting ripped to play
Cable — he's also staying fit to once again

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:46.879
play Thanos in Avengers: Infinity War.

00:03:46.879 --> 00:03:51.650
Yes, Thanos is largely CGI and makeup, but
the wizards at Marvel will also be putting

00:03:51.650 --> 00:03:55.700
as much of Brolin's physical performance on
screen as they can through the process of

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:56.819
motion capture.

00:03:56.819 --> 00:04:00.249
Fortunately, Brolin's done the hard work,
and the whole world will get to see the fruits

00:04:00.249 --> 00:04:05.329
of his labor when the one-two punch of a new
Avengers movie and Deadpool 2 hit cinemas

00:04:05.329 --> 00:04:06.360
in 2018.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:07.360
Thanks for watching!

